            <CornerDownLeft size={11} /> queues for after this step · <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>Shift</kbd> <CornerDownLeft size={11} /> interrupts and sends now · <kbd>Esc</kbd> to stop
          </span>
        ) : (
